{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"eb903157-6eb9-4dd8-8710-2e428622c046","agentId":"a1383ccced788ce49","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"调研 SAT solver 的 restart 策略 2024-2026 进展（Luby / geometric / LBD / glucose / chronological backtracking）。\n\n**背景：** Round 4 提过 restart_period / restart_algorithms 参数，但没深挖。restart 对长跑 UNSAT 证明影响大。\n\n**调研重点（≤800 字）：**\n1. 经典 restart 策略对比\n2. Glucose 的 LBD-based restart\n3. Chronological backtracking (CDCL-CB)\n4. CP-SAT restart 相关参数\n5. 长跑场景下哪个最优\n\n输出末尾：\"我们硬候选 INFEASIBLE 证明的 restart 推荐配置\"。"},"uuid":"748f07f3-8c25-4854-8c85-b4b01cb6f2e7","timestamp":"2026-05-07T22:06:16.813Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd\\.upstream_clones","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
